{"name":"Nightly","hex":"#536078","fetched":"2026-10-16","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"nightly","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Happening or appearing in the night; night-time; nocturnal.","Performing, occurring, or taking place every night."]},{"part":"Adverb","definitions":["Every night."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/nightly"}],"entries":[{"title":"Night","blocks":[{"text":"Night, or nighttime, is the period of darkness when the Sun is below the horizon. Daylight illuminates one side of Earth, leaving the other in darkness. The opposite of nighttime is daytime. Earth's rotation causes the appearance of sunrise and sunset. Moonlight, airglow, starlight, and light pollution dimly illuminate night. The duration of day, night, and twilight varies depending on the time of year and the observer's latitude."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6d/Savault_Chapel_Under_Milky_Way_BLS.jpg/330px-Savault_Chapel_Under_Milky_Way_BLS.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Night"},{"title":"Nightly (band)","blocks":[{"text":"Nightly is an alternative pop band from Nashville, Tennessee, consisting of Jonathan Capeci, Joey Beretta, and Nicholas Sainato. Capeci and Beretta are formerly of Dinner And A Suit. The band is currently independent and managed by Neon Coast."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/2e/Nightly_logo.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nightly_(band)"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6d/Savault_Chapel_Under_Milky_Way_BLS.jpg/500px-Savault_Chapel_Under_Milky_Way_BLS.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6d/Savault_Chapel_Under_Milky_Way_BLS.jpg/1280px-Savault_Chapel_Under_Milky_Way_BLS